<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
	<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
	<title>Reset your password — Housing &amp; Roommate</title>
	<style>
		body { margin: 0; padding: 0; word-spacing: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
		.preheader { display: none !important; visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; color: transparent; height: 0; width: 0; }
		@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
			.email-canvas { background-color: #171410 !important; }
			.email-footer { color: #8b857b !important; }
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body class="email-canvas" style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F4F1EA;">
	<span class="preheader" style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;">A one-time code to reset your password.&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;</span>

	<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#F4F1EA;">
		<tr>
			<td align="center" style="padding:40px 16px 48px;">

				<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:100%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E9E3D7;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;">

					<tr>
						<td style="padding:26px 36px;background-color:#0F5B47;border-radius:16px 16px 0 0;">
							<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
								<tr>
									<td style="width:30px;height:30px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:8px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#0F5B47;text-align:center;line-height:30px;">H</td>
									<td style="padding-left:11px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.1px;">Housing &amp; Roommate</td>
								</tr>
							</table>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr><td style="height:4px;background-color:#E8A33D;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr>

					<tr>
						<td style="padding:36px 36px 8px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;">

							<span style="display:inline-block;padding:6px 14px;background-color:#FBF1DE;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#96660A;">Password reset</span>

							<h1 style="margin:22px 0 0;font-size:27px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.6px;color:#1B1712;">Reset your password</h1>

							<p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A443C;">Hi <%= name %>, we received a request to reset the password on your account. Enter the code below in the app to choose a new one.</p>

							<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:28px 0 0;">
								<tr>
									<% otp.toString().split("").forEach(function(d) { %>
									<td style="width:46px;height:56px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#FDF8EE;border:1px solid #F0DCAE;border-radius:12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:#96660A;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;"><%= d %></td>
									<td style="width:8px;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td>
									<% }) %>
								</tr>
							</table>

							<p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A443C;">This code expires in <strong style="color:#1B1712;"><%= expirationMinutes %> minutes</strong>.</p>

							<p style="margin:26px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background-color:#F8F5EF;border:1px solid #E9E3D7;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#847C6F;">If you didn't ask for a reset, ignore this email — your current password keeps working and nothing changes.</p>

						</td>
					</tr>

					<tr>
						<td class="email-footer" style="padding:28px 36px 32px;border-top:1px solid #E9E3D7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A29A8C;">
							You're receiving this message because a password reset was requested for your Housing &amp; Roommate account.<br>
							&copy; <%= year %> Housing &amp; Roommate Management Platform. All rights reserved.
						</td>
					</tr>

				</table>

			</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
</body>
</html>
